    "difficulty": "medium",
    "context_text": "Every year, millions of people visit the ancient city to explore its rich history and beautiful architecture. However, visitors are reminded to respect the local customs and _______ any damage to the historical sites.",
    "question": "Choose the best word to complete the sentence.",
