    "context_text": "Last weekend, Sophie and her friends went hiking in the mountains. They planned to camp overnight but arrived late because they took a wrong trail. Despite feeling tired, Sophie insisted on setting up the tents before dark. Once settled, they realized they forgot to bring enough food. Sophie suggested they ration what they had and promised to find edible plants nearby the next morning.",
