    "context_text": "Emma: I just finished reading the email about the new school schedule. It says classes will start earlier next semester.\nLiam: Yeah, I noticed that too. It means we have less time in the morning to get ready.\nEmma: True, but I think it might help us finish earlier in the afternoon, which is good for after-school activities.\nLiam: I’m not sure. I usually feel tired in the morning, so waking up earlier might be harder for me.\nEmma: Maybe we’ll get used to it after a few weeks. The school said they made the change to improve focus during classes.",
